 ],
 "text": "What if everyone on Earth woke up 10% Nigerian? I'm Nigerian. Let me walk you through it. Day 1. Every DNA test says Nigeria, 8.2 billion people with Nigerian roots. Yesterday, it was 237 million. Day 2. The people who hated us are us now. Hate forums go quiet, family group chats don't. Day 3. Every parent on Earth asks why you're not a doctor yet. Week 1. Everyone wants the passport. The embassy says no. You need a Nigerian parent and 10% doesn't count. Week 2. Jolof Wars go global. Ghana still says theirs is better. Month 1. Afrobeats is just music now. People already found Nigerian artists over 1 billion times on Spotify last year. Year 1. Money flows to Lagos. The diaspora already sends home $21 billion a year. Now everyone has an auntie in Lagos. 10 years later. Racism doesn't survive the family reunion. So what's the first thing you do as a 10% Nigerian? Follow for part 2."
